stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> SUBMITTED : Victim files complaint
    SUBMITTED --> UNDER_REVIEW : Admin begins triage
    UNDER_REVIEW --> VALIDATED : Incident confirmed valid
    UNDER_REVIEW --> REJECTED : False / Duplicate report
    VALIDATED --> ASSIGNED : Investigator assigned
    ASSIGNED --> UNDER_INVESTIGATION : Officer opens case
    UNDER_INVESTIGATION --> WAITING_FOR_INFORMATION : Officer requests victim info
    WAITING_FOR_INFORMATION --> UNDER_INVESTIGATION : Victim provides details
    UNDER_INVESTIGATION --> RESOLVED : Case findings finalized
    RESOLVED --> CLOSED : Admin closes case record
    REJECTED --> [*]
    CLOSED --> [*]
